  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMMIT 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity is to increase access to and sustainability of quality TB diagnosis, treatment and prevention services through the effective linkages to the health system; engagement of communities, health facilities, and the private sector; and improved data collection and use through sustainable expansion of the TB information system; in order to maximize health outcomes among Cambodians, including vulnerable populations.</narrative>
  </description>
